      "features": [],
      "notes": [
        "This fully modular system plays a key role during ACL and PCL reconstructive",
        "surgeries to prepare soft tissue and bone-tendon-bone autografts or allografts.",
        "The system allows the surgeon to interchange the various components to clean,",
        "whip stitch, measure, pre-tension, or add a fixation device.",
        "The sizing block, sold separately, can accommodate grafts from 3.0mm to 13mm,",
        "in 0.5mm increments.",
        "The universal slide locks allow for any of the graft preparation table components to",
        "be changed intraoperatively, easily and quickly. The slide locks are also fully adjustable",
        "via the spring loaded locking button, for one handed adjustments.",
        "The Tension Clamp is etched in both Pounds (30 lbs. max) and Newtons",
        "(120 N max) for quick referencing during pre-tensioning of the graft for",
        "those surgeons who feel it is necessary for satisfactory post-op results.",
        "The Graft Clamps are designed to act as an extra set of hands and incorporate",
        "atraumatic teeth to prevent damage to the graft."
      ],
